Definitions

Pn or           Defines the element to be held low.
Function
Equation        ş  The pin or node name defined in the pin or node
                   statement of the declaration segment

                ş  The Pn.function defined in an earlier functional
                   equation
ú
Use
GND is normally used in functional equations.  You can enter 0 instead
of GND anywhere you want an unconditional low value.

Important: You must define the GND pin in the pin statements.
ú
